      "options": {"content": "A specialist view of bounded protocol activity, showing whether traffic progresses beyond opening a connection. It compares Telnet, MQTT, CoAP, and UPnP actions without exposing raw payloads, topics, client IDs, or source IPs.\n\nActions per completed session and early disconnect are provisional Telnet/MQTT views. Cross-protocol shallow/deep classification remains deferred until interaction-depth semantics are approved.\n\nAll dashboard timestamps are displayed in UTC (UTC+00:00).", "mode": "markdown"},
      "title": "Dashboard Purpose & Interpretation",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {"collapsed": false, "gridPos": {"h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 5}, "id": 2, "panels": [], "title": "Available Protocol Actions", "type": "row"},
