      "options": {"content": "# Implementation Status\n\nThis dashboard represents the Protocol Interaction Depth metric branch.\n\nAvailable now:\n- `eventhorizon_protocol_actions_total`\n- bounded Telnet, MQTT, CoAP, and UPnP action labels\n- completed-session denominator for Telnet and MQTT\n\nStill required:\n- mentor-approved cross-protocol interaction-depth semantics\n- shallow/deep session classification\n- validation for actions-per-session interpretation\n\nThese items are deferred because they require a protocol-aware definition, not another generic counter. The dashboard becomes fully active after that definition and metric branch are approved.\n\n```text\nProtocol Interaction Depth\n|-- Telnet actions\n|-- MQTT actions\n|-- Client actions per completed session\n`-- Shallow vs deep sessions\n```", "mode": "markdown"},
